WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:13.390
Hey Thoughty2 here, let's have a peak inside
some of the most secretive places on earth.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:18.130
Shrouded in mystery, dens for the rich and
powerful, where minds get together and hatch

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.360
shady plans.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.270
These are the places you're just not aloud
to go.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:23.490
Room 39

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:28.960
North Korea as a whole is a unnervingly secretive
place, but there's one room, in one building

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.590
that's the most secretive of all; Room 39.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:38.500
Established in the late 1970s, Room 39 is
a government organisation, directly controlled

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.840
by the Kim family.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:45.560
The goal of Room 39 is to seek underhanded
and malicious ways to illegally obtain foreign

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.560
currencies.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.980
It is rumoured the organisation utilises 10
to 20 bank accounts in China and Switzerland

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:57.070
for the purposes of money laundering, counterfeiting
and general shady transactions.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:02.580
It is widely speculated that Room 39 is deeply
involved in government controlled drug smuggling

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.300
and illicit weapon sales.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:09.870
We know that the organisation has 120 foreign
trade companies under its jurisdiction.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:14.450
Nobody knows how it got it's name, but the
Room itself is said to be located inside a

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:18.400
ruling Workers' Party building in the capital
city Pyongyang.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.540
Club 33

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:24.980
Somewhat less malicious, but just as secretive
is Disneland's Club 33.

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:31.360
Club 33 is a strictly member's only club and
restaurant, discreetly located above the Blue

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:33.110
Bayou in New Orleans Square.

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:39.700
To become a member and step inside the notorious
doorway you will need about $30,000, but even

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:42.350
then there's a fourteen year waiting list.

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:46.439
There's a strict member limit of only 487
people.

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:50.450
The club has been frequented by presidents,
prime ministers, actors and billionaires.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.050
It's the only place in Disneyland where you
can buy an alcoholic beverage.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:53.660
Area 51

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:59.220
Located in southern Nevada, in the United
States, Area 51 is large secretive military

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:04.720
airfield, and arguably the most infamous and
controversial location in this video.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:11.000
The use of lethal force is authorised if anyone
attempts to step foot inside the base's perimeter.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:16.319
The base's primary function is to develop
and test experimental aircraft and weapons

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:17.319
systems.

00:02:17.319 --> 00:02:22.350
However, because of the government's incredibly
tight grasp on the base's secrecy, Area 51

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:25.690
has been the subject of many UFO conspiracies.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:30.720
Many believe the base is used to examine and
attempt to reverse engineer crashed alien

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:35.450
spaceships, alien technology, and even alien
lifeforms.

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.010
White's Gentlemen's Club

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:43.420
Founded in 1693 by Francesco Bianco, White's
is the most exclusive gentlemen's club in

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:44.420
existence.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:49.420
White's is located in London, England and
gained a reputation for it's exclusivity and

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:52.200
often laddish behaviour of its members.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:56.660
Women are completely banned from the club,
the only woman to have ever been entertained

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.250
by the club is Queen Elizabeth II.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:03.610
The only way to become a member of the club
and step foot inside the door, is to first

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:08.650
be a man and second be invited by a current
member of the club, who has the support of

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:09.850
two other members.

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:14.630
Which, unless you're best buddies with a member
of the Royal family or a powerful politician,

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.270
isn't likely to happen.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:19.340
Current notable members include Prince Charles
and Prince William.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:24.650
British Prime Minister David Cameron was a
former member for 15 years, but resigned in

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:28.980
2008 because he disagreed with the club's
male-only policy.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:33.880
The club is famous for its betting book in
which members make outrageous bets, such as

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:39.470
a £3,000 bet on which of two raindrops would
slide down the window first.

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:41.230
RAF Menwith Hill

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:45.180
Menwith Hill is a Royal Air Force base in
North Yorkshire, England.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:51.160
The primary job of this mysterious RAF base
is to spy on and intercept enemy signals,

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.239
satellites and missiles.

00:03:53.239 --> 00:03:58.380
The base has heavy connections with the global
ECHELON spy network, the ECHELON network is

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:04.680
a close-nit global spy alliance between the
United Kingdom, United States, Canada, Australia

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.000
and New Zealand.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.970
RAF Menwith Hill is the largest electronic
monitoring station in the world and a lot

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:14.959
of its work is done on behalf of the US National
Security Agency.

00:04:14.959 --> 00:04:20.329
Menwith Hill originally created during the
Cold War to spy on the Soviet Union and their

00:04:20.329 --> 00:04:21.329
allies.

00:04:21.329 --> 00:04:24.440
But it has since been used to spy on terrorists
and drug dealers.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:30.250
It has even been used to monitor and gain
intelligence on foreign political and diplomatic

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:31.250
bodies.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:36.630
Some believe it has been heavily involved
with commercial espionage and mass eavesdropping

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:40.070
on telephone and radio communications.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.850
Mount Weather Emergency Operations Center

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:48.750
Deep in the forests of the U.S. state of Virginia
is a last resort base, setup incase an "end

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:51.560
of the world" situation ever arises.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:57.220
Mount Weather Emergency Operations Center
was setup by FEMA, the Federal Emergency Management

00:04:57.220 --> 00:05:02.410
Agency, it is where high profile individuals
and government officials will shelter from

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:04.990
the impending doom during an apocalypse.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:09.561
Very little is known about the base because
it's details are highly classified, the base

00:05:09.561 --> 00:05:12.910
is constantly protected by armed guards and
razor wire.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:18.970
The complex consists of two extremely large
areas, Area A, which is above ground, contains

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:23.970
dormitories, a laboratory, a training area,
an on-site sewage treatment plant and two

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:30.970
water tanks holding 250,000 gallons of water,
amongst many other facilities, it is said

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.870
the complex is completely self-contained.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:39.340
Area B is entirely underground, some believe
there is an entire self-sustaining city below

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:45.160
ground, that apparently consists of private
apartments, streets and sidewalks, cafeterias

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:51.100
and hospitals, a power plant, an underground
mass transit system and a TV network.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.310
Mount Yamantaw

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:58.260
Mount Yamantaw is the tallest mountain in
the Ural mountain range in Russia, standing

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:01.150
at 1,640 metres (5,381 ft) tall.

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:05.050
In the local language, Mount Yamantaw means
"evil mountain".

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:09.290
The U.S. government strongly believe that
hidden deep within the mountain is a massive

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:14.000
stockpile of nuclear weapons housed in an
underground military facility.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:22.060
There is a top secret town just south of the
mountain called Mezhgorye, the town is permanently

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:27.389
closed to the outside world some believe the
town contains a human civilisation employed

00:06:27.389 --> 00:06:29.460
to develop nuclear weaponry.

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:34.190
The U.S. government has repeatedly asked Russia
what it's hiding there and their answers are

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:35.780
strangely inconsistent.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:40.900
Over the years Russia have said it's a mining
site, a repository for Russian treasures,

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:46.250
a food storage area and last but not least
a bunker for leaders in case of a nuclear

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.250
war.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.770
Come on Russia, make your mind up.

